flowchart TB
  accTitle: Both prerequisites must complete
  accDescr: A and B are prerequisites of C, and C is a prerequisite of D. In the shown snapshot A is complete and B is pending, so C and D remain blocked. Completing B can make C eligible, but D still requires C to complete.
  A["A: complete"] --> C["C: blocked"]
  B["B: pending"] --> C
  C --> D["D: blocked"]
  class A success;
  class B pending;
  class C,D neutral;

  classDef control fill:#F5F3FF,stroke:#7C3AED,color:#111827;
  classDef neutral fill:#F3F4F6,stroke:#4B5563,color:#111827;
  classDef success fill:#DCFCE7,stroke:#15803D,color:#111827;
  classDef pending fill:#FFFBEB,stroke:#B45309,color:#111827;
  classDef failure fill:#FEE2E2,stroke:#B91C1C,color:#111827;

